  "title": "SVG 动画初接触",
  "summary": "初入 SVG 动画坑，小记录如下。",
  "content": "<p>初入 SVG 动画坑，小记录如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>g=group，群组标签；</li>\n<li>g 标签的动画不同于 rect 和 c 的属性动画，没有 xy 位置属性，属于 transform 动画，transform包括坐标的变换和缩放；</li>\n<li>SVG 图形由颜色属性和形状属性组成；</li>\n<li>path 并没有 xy 位置属性，相同形状不同位置的图形标记为不同的 path；</li>\n<li>通用属性与独有属性；</li>\n<li>Windows 下不同浏览器对svg动画的兼容性不同，Firefox最好（两种动画都能显示），Chrome 次之（只显示透明度动画），IE 最差（不显示动画，IE8 及以下不支持 SVG 图形的显示）；</li>\n<li>OSX 下 Chrome，Firefox，Safari 均完美支持 SVG 动画；</li>\n<li>SVG 动画可以有效的解决 gif 锯齿严重的问题，但是 Chrome 表示很快也将不支持 SVG 动画了，需要的请用 CSS 来编写：</li>\n<li>本次 SVG 代码如下：</li>\n</ul>\n<div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><span>&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;!-- Generator: Adobe Illustrator 19.2.1, SVG Export Plug-In . SVG Version: 6.00 Build 0)  --&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;svg version=&quot;1.1&quot; id=&quot;图层_1&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; xmlns:xlink=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink&quot; x=&quot;0px&quot; y=&quot;0px&quot;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>   </span></span><span>viewBox=&quot;0 0 140.7 134&quot; style=&quot;enable-background:new 0 0 140.7 134;&quot; xml:space=&quot;preserve&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>  </span></span><span>.st0{fill:url(#SVGID_1_);}</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;/style&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;g transform=&quot;translate(0,0)&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div>\n</div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;linearGradient id=&quot;SVGID_1_&quot; gradientUnits=&quot;userSpaceOnUse&quot; x1=&quot;94.138&quot; y1=&quot;-318.8234&quot; x2=&quot;125.0649&quot; y2=&quot;-349.7503&quot; gradientTransform=&quot;matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 -232)&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;stop  offset=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;stop-color:#FFFFFF&quot;/&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;stop  offset=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;stop-color:#FFF0C9&quot;/&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>  </span></span><span>&lt;/linearGradient&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>  </span></span><span>&lt;path class=&quot;st0&quot; d=&quot;M122.3,97.3l-1.1-3.1c-0.4-1-1.5-1.7-2.5-1.4c-1.2,0.3-1.9,1.6-1.5,2.7l1,3h-0.4l-2.8-7.8</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>c-0.4-1-1.5-1.7-2.5-1.4c-1.2,0.3-1.9,1.6-1.5,2.7l2.7,8.2h-0.3l-3.9-9.8c-0.4-1-1.5-1.7-2.5-1.4c-1.2,0.3-1.9,1.6-1.5,2.7l3.3,9.2</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>l-0.4,0.2l-6.8-17.6c-0.4-1-1.5-1.7-2.5-1.4c-1.2,0.3-1.9,1.6-1.5,2.7l7.6,21.2l0,0l0.5,1.6c0.6,1.2,0.2,2.6-1.4,1.7</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>c-1.2-0.6-2.3-2.5-3.3-4.2l-2.3-3.3c-0.6-1-2-1.3-3-0.6c-0.9,0.7-1,1.9-0.5,2.8c0,0,4.1,6.7,5.6,8.9c4.7,6.8,12.5,10.3,16.1,8.6</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>l4-1.4c4.6-1.6,7.2-6.2,5.4-11.2L122.3,97.3L122.3,97.3z&quot;/&gt;</span></div></div><div><div>\n</div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;animate id=&quot;a1&quot; accumulate=&quot;none&quot; additive=&quot;replace&quot; arrributeid=&quot;a1&quot; attributeName=&quot;fill-opacity&quot; attributeType=&quot;CSS&quot; begin=&quot;0s&quot; calcMode=&quot;linear&quot; dur=&quot;2s&quot; fill=&quot;remove&quot; repeatCount=&quot;indefinite&quot; restart=&quot;always&quot; values=&quot;0;1&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;/animate&gt;</span></div></div><div><div>\n</div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;animateTransform  Type=&quot;translate&quot; accumulate=&quot;none&quot; additive=&quot;replace&quot; attributeName=&quot;transform&quot; begin=&quot;0s&quot; by=&quot;-20 -50&quot; calcMode=&quot;linear&quot;  dur=&quot;2s&quot; fill=&quot;remove&quot; repeatCount=&quot;indefinite&quot; restart=&quot;always&quot; type=&quot;translate&quot;&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>&lt;/animateTransform&gt;</span></div></div><div><div><span>&lt;/g&gt;</span></div></div><div><div>\n</div></div><div><div><span>&lt;/svg&gt;</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div></div></figure></div>",
